&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary for this exempt-level position will be based on experience and qualifications within an established pay range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pay range: $135,000 - $160,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 66, 138);&quot;&gt;BENEFITS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Element Science offers a very competitive salary and benefits package including, but not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
