&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly motivated Senior Product Manager to join our team.&amp;nbsp; You are an experienced product manager who considers empathy to be a strength that helps you to develop a deeper understanding of customer needs so that you drive exceptional value for customers. In this role you will work closely with cross-functional teams, including engineering and design to define requirements that drive growth, innovation, and value for our customers, and you will collaborate with product marketing to bring your product to market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will be experienced, detail-oriented, and a high-ownership product manager who has experience delivering results through coordinating, aligning, and motivating a large group of distributed global stakeholders.&amp;nbsp; You will define and own a 6-18 roadmap that aligns to our high-level strategic platform vision.&amp;nbsp; You have excellent communication skills, and you are equally comfortable working with engineering teams as well as presenting to sales, customers and non-technical teams. You are flexible to work with teams in North American and Hungary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
