&lt;li&gt;Study and understand the market by performing studying market trends, analyzing competitors, assessing data and collecting customer research to shape the roadmap and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect and analyze feedback from customers, ideas and product metrics data to prioritize and boost customer product satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorously, prioritize the backlog, define success criteria, own trade-off decisions and guide the engineering and UX design teams on the right design choices for our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be involved in product launch/release processes to coordinate x-functionally with your product marketing partner to inform product positioning, packaging and supporting collateral.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own customer/stakeholder engagement for major product issues and design product value propositions for large audiences (e.g., PR, Marketing, Sales).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and track product usage and adoption metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience/Skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
