&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills, with the ability to prioritize and manage multiple projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cross-functional teams, including design, engineering, product marketing, and sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to influence and build relationships with stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset and strong problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of agile development methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
