&lt;li&gt;Passion for technology and a strong desire to innovate and drive change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience/Skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business, engineering, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within the Governance, Risk, Compliance or Policy Management domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Jira, Aha!, Pendo and/or comparable tools is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
